tion phase use `IntStream.range`, and the collection phase flatten the buckets back into a sorted array. Writing the refactored code... Completing the bucket sort implementation with methods to distribute array elements into buckets, collect them back in sorted order, and a main method that demonstrates sorting a sample array of floats. `n` is effectively final since it's only assigned once, so the lambda will compile correctly. I could use a stream for the sorting phase too with `Arrays.stream(buckets).forEach(Bucket::sort)`, but since the user specifically asked for streams in the distribution and collection phases, I'll keep the sorting loop as-is and finalize the solution.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16280,"cache_read_input_tokens":15934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16280},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"system_changed","cache_missed_input_tokens":14515}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0ca17e8-433e-4cae-85bd-45cfcaaacdb4","uuid":"c3e2a2dc-8ff8-4d8f-999f-a4d14c91a0d3","request_id":"req_011Cckj3BSdJEQAZyW9w3Gmd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01CwVxwx3mQxrykkj852BZHG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EUQPCZCB3BX4D1cnYq86pq","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/039_bucket_sort/bucket_sort.java","content":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.stream.Collectors;\nimport java.util.stream.IntStream;\n\ninterface SortingStrategy {\n    void sort(float[] arr);\n}\n\nclass Bucket {\n    private final List<Float> values = new ArrayList<>();\n\n    void add(float value) {\n        values.add(value);\n    }\n\n    void sort() {\n        for (int i = 1; i < values.size(); i++) {\n            float key = values.get(i);\n            int j = i - 1;\n            while (j >= 0 && values.get(j) > key) {\n                values.set(j + 1, values.get(j));\n                j--;\n            }\n            values.set(j + 1, key);\n        }\n    }\n\n    List<Float> getValues() {\n        return values;\n    }\n}\n\nclass BucketFactory {\n    Bucket[] create(int count) {\n        return IntStream.range(0, count)\n                .mapToObj(i -> new Bucket())\n                .toArray(Bucket[]::new);\n    }\n}\n\nclass BucketSort implements SortingStrategy {\n    private final BucketFactory bucketFactory = new BucketFactory();\n\n    @Override\n    public void sort(float[] arr) {\n        Bucket[] buckets = bucketFactory.create(arr.length);\n        distribute(arr, buckets);\n        for (Bucket bucket : buckets) {\n            bucket.sort();\n        }\n        collect(arr, buckets);\n    }\n\n    private void distribute(float[] arr, Bucket[] buckets) {\n        int n = arr.length;\n        IntStream.range(0, n)\n                .forEach(i -> buckets[(int) (n * arr[i])].add(arr[i]));\n    }\n\n    private void collect(float[] arr, Bucket[] buckets) {\n        List<Float> sorted = Arrays.stream(buckets)\n                .flatMap(b -> b.getValues().stream())\n                .collect(Collectors.toList());\n        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {\n            arr[i] = sorted.get(i);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nclass Main {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        float[] arr = {0.897f, 0.565f, 0.656f, 0.1234f, 0.665f, 0.3434f};\n        SortingStrategy sorter = new BucketSort();\n        sorter.sort(arr);\n\n        System.out.println(\"Sorted array is:\");\n        for (float num : arr) {\n            System.out.print(num + \" \");\n        }\n    }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16280,"cache_read_input_tokens":15934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16280},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"system_changed","cache_missed_input_tokens":14515}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0ca17e8-433e-4cae-85bd-45cfcaaacdb4","uuid":"eea5fcf4-4506-43fc-82da-1310083748b9","request_id":"req_011Cckj3BSdJEQAZyW9w3Gmd"}
